{"id": "EUVD-2026-100483", "enisaUuid": "c18cb28d-b8dc-325e-8188-450d153c2f8b", "description": "When the authorize() method is called with a maxAge parameter, the auth0.js library does not validate the auth_time claim in the resulting ID token against the requested maxAge value. As a result, an application may process an ID token that represents an authentication event older than the requested maximum age.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T20:08:21", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T18:40:31", "baseScore": 5.4, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:N", "references": ["https://trust.okta.com/security-advisories/missing-verification-of-auth_time-claim-in-auth0-js-cve-2026-107371", "https://github.com/auth0/auth0.js/security/advisories/GHSA-42v6-5rcc-mq4v"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-107371"], "assigner": "Okta", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "42e65037-3806-30c7-bf1c-23c58b6fdceb", "product": {"name": "auth0.js", "vendor": {"name": "auth0"}}, "product_version": "9.12.0 <10.3.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "09bfbd87-45de-34e8-af6f-0b83919f115e", "vendor": {"name": "auth0"}}], "isExploited": false}